From d48ea025f09d0d082bf852b64a149d8613dfb11a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 14:32:27 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3369/5749] refactor(circuit-breaker): replace sliding window
 with consecutive call detection

Switch background task loop detection from percentage-based sliding window
(80% of 20-call window) to consecutive same-tool counting. Triggers when
same tool signature is called 20+ times in a row; a different tool resets
the counter.
